113	/****************************************************************************
114	 * Name: board_boot_image
115	 *
116	 * Description:
117	 *   Called by nxboot (via BOARDIOC_BOOT_IMAGE) to load the application
118	 *   image from NAND flash into PSRAM and jump to it.
119	 *
120	 *   IMPORTANT: PSRAM is NOT re-initialized here.  The PSRAM controller
121	 *   was set up during early boot (HAL_PreInit → bsp_psramc_init).
122	 *   Re-initializing PSRAM would destroy the application code and data
123	 *   that we copy from NAND.
124	 *
125	 * Input Parameters:
126	 *   path     - Path to the NAND MTD partition (e.g. "/dev/ota0")
127	 *   hdr_size - Size of the nxboot image header (CONFIG_NXBOOT_HEADER_SIZE)
128	 *
129	 ****************************************************************************/
